\newlabel{fig:court-perkp}{{5.3}{35}{Accuracy at seven pixels for each of the fourteen keypoints. The two stride-one models are uniformly high across all landmarks, whereas the two stride-four models are lower across every landmark rather than failing on any particular one, which is consistent with a resolution-limited rather than a landmark-specific cause.\relax }{figure.caption.19}{}}
